---
// The React island. Astro's client directives only work on framework
// components from a .astro file, so this wrapper exists to give Seek one.
//
// client:idle, not client:load. The control has a spring and a magnet and
// is nicer for being present on the first frame, but it is not the reason
// anyone came to this page, and the documentation header is the first
// thing every reader's browser parses here. Idle hydration keeps that off
// the critical path; the Pagefind index itself is a further step out
// still, imported on the first keystroke rather than with the component.
//
// size={44} is the whole reason this wrapper passes anything. The control
// defaults to the 64 it was drawn at, which is half again as tall as every
// other control in this bar — and the bar is a fixed-height box, so the
// overflow painted the bar's own background across the top of the page
// title. 44 is the height of the theme toggle beside it, and at 44 the
// component's lens lands at 0.44 of the circle, the same band the rest of
// the bar's round buttons sit in.
import { Seek } from "./Seek";
---

<Seek client:idle size={44} framePad={0} />
